    "description": "The Manage Fitness Memberships API allows users to efficiently freeze their fitness membership accounts. By submitting a freeze request, members can pause their membership agreement during specific times, accommodating personal scheduling needs or unforeseen circumstances. This functionality is particularly useful for gym members who may be traveling or unable to visit the gym for an extended period. Typical consumers of this API include fitness center operators and membership management systems that aim to enhance customer service by providing flexible membership options.",
